---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "October 10, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service | IT Support Bee">
  <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0f0224] pt-32 pb-32 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <header class="mb-12 text-center">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 mb-6 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase border-2 border-[#2D058A] text-[#2D058A] dark:border-[#90ee02] dark:text-[#90ee02] rounded-full shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(45,5,138,1)] dark:shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(144,238,2,0.4)]"
        >
          Legal
        </div>
        <h1
          class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-[#2D058A] dark:text-white tracking-tighter mb-4 leading-tight"
        >
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p
          class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest"
        >
          Last Updated: {lastUpdated}
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Content Container -->
      <div
        class="bg-white dark:bg-[#150734] border-4 border-[#2D058A] dark:border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-16 shadow-[12px_12px_0px_0px_rgba(45,5,138,1)] dark:shadow-[12px_12px_0px_0px_rgba(144,238,2,0.3)]"
      >
        <article
          class="prose prose-lg md:prose-xl prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none custom-prose"
        >
          <p>
            Welcome to <strong>IT Support Bee</strong>. By accessing this
            website, we assume you accept these terms and conditions. Do not
            continue to use IT Support Bee if you do not agree to take all of
            the terms and conditions stated on this page.
          </p>

          <h2>1. Terminology</h2>
          <p>
            The following terminology applies to these Terms of Service, Privacy
            Statement, and Disclaimer Notice: "Client", "You", and "Your" refers
            to you, the person logging on to this website and compliant to the
            Company’s terms and conditions. "The Company", "Ourselves", "We",
            "Our", and "Us", refers to our Company, IT Support Bee.
          </p>

          <h2>2. Services Provided</h2>
          <p>
            IT Support Bee offers remote IT support, cloud infrastructure
            management (including Google Workspace and Microsoft 365
            migrations), web development, and email deliverability services. We
            reserve the right to withdraw or amend our services without notice.
            We will not be liable if, for any reason, all or any part of the
            website or services are unavailable at any time.
          </p>

          <h2>3. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
          <p>
            Unless otherwise stated, IT Support Bee and/or its licensors own the
            intellectual property rights for all material on IT Support Bee. All
            intellectual property rights are reserved. You may access this from
            IT Support Bee for your own personal use subjected to restrictions
            set in these terms and conditions.
          </p>
          <p>You must not:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Republish material from IT Support Bee</li>
            <li>Sell, rent, or sub-license material from IT Support Bee</li>
            <li>Reproduce, duplicate, or copy material from IT Support Bee</li>
            <li>
              Redistribute content from IT Support Bee without explicit
              permission
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2>4. User Responsibilities</h2>
          <p>
            When engaging our services (e.g., DNS management, email migrations),
            you must ensure that you hold the legal right to grant us access to
            your company's digital infrastructure. You agree to provide accurate
            and complete information when requesting support or booking a
            strategy call.
          </p>

          <h2>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            In no event shall IT Support Bee, nor any of its officers,
            directors, and employees, be held liable for anything arising out of
            or in any way connected with your use of this website or our
            technical services. IT Support Bee shall not be held liable for any
            indirect, consequential, or special liability arising out of or in
            any way related to data loss, downtime, or security breaches outside
            of our direct control.
          </p>

          <h2>6. Modifications to Terms</h2>
          <p>
            We may revise these Terms of Service for our website at any time
            without prior notice. By using this website, you are agreeing to be
            bound by the current version of these Terms and Conditions.
          </p>

          <h2>7. Contact Information</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions or concerns regarding our Terms of
            Service, please contact us at:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Email: <a href="mailto:hello@itsupportbee.com"
                >hello@itsupportbee.com</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              Website: <a href="https://itsupportbee.com">itsupportbee.com</a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  /* Markdown Typography Spacing & Colors for Legal Pages */
  .custom-prose p {
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem !important;
    line-height: 1.8 !important;
  }

  .custom-prose h2 {
    color: #2d058a;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-top: 3.5rem !important;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem !important;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .dark .custom-prose h2 {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .custom-prose ul,
  .custom-prose ol {
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem !important;
    padding-left: 1.5rem !important;
  }

  .custom-prose li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;
    line-height: 1.7 !important;
  }

  .custom-prose a {
    color: #2d058a;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .dark .custom-prose a {
    color: #90ee02;
  }

  .custom-prose strong {
    color: #111827;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  /* Dark mode text readability fix */
  .dark .custom-prose p,
  .dark .custom-prose li,
  .dark .custom-prose ul,
  .dark .custom-prose ol {
    color: #e2e8f0 !important;
  }

  .dark .custom-prose strong {
    color: #ffffff !important;
  }
</style>
